        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/catawissa_missouri",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "A conservation area acquired in 1978 from a former gravel mine now offers boating on the Meramec and habitat for deer, turkey, and bass.",
